{"blocks": [{"bbox": [0.0, 0.0, 879.0, 695.0], "text": "", "type": "Page"}, {"bbox": [33.90673828125, 33.935546875, 207.36570739746094, 86.0780029296875], "text": "MAKING NEW FRIENDS", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [33.90673828125, 107.9150390625, 391.8870849609375, 141.99713134765625], "text": "AKE your pick of student organisations, societies and interest groups offering a wide array of social and professional opportunities.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [62.6630859375, 149.31640625, 387.47210693359375, 186.66717529296875], "text": "Develop your leadership skills, pursue your passion and expand your network of friends by engaging in a diverse range of student-run activities.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [18.70556640625, 183.251953125, 419.07763671875, 662.421875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [473.3919982910156, 33.935546875, 639.1019897460938, 45.16986083984375], "text": "NUSSU CLUBS AND COMMITTEES", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [471.68994140625, 48.1884765625, 525.76904296875, 57.77239990234375], "text": "nussu.org.sg", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [471.68994140625, 59.7265625, 639.5570068359375, 148.90631103515625], "text": "All full-time undergraduate students are members of the NUS Students' Union (NUSSU) and their respective faculty constituent clubs. NUSSU, led by the NUSSU Council and Executive Committee, comprises a total of 15 constituent clubs and nine committees.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [466.1103515625, 166.0126953125, 654.9580078125, 306.3701171875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [485.853515625, 320.01220703125, 629.6885375976562, 434.09893798828125], "text": "NUSSU traces its roots to its early predecessor, the University of Malaya Students' Union (UMSU), which was established in 1949. UMSU then evolved into the University of Singapore Students' Union (USSU), and took its present form as NUSSU in 1980, following the inception of NUS.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [486.28271484375, 449.64599609375, 627.78759765625, 538.0764312744141], "text": "Generations of NUSSU executive committee members and volunteers gathered at the NUSS Kent Ridge Guild House on 23 August 2019 to reconnect with old friends and celebrate the Union's 70th anniversary.", "type": "Text"}, {"bbox": [654.9580078125, 31.69970703125, 847.2392578125, 193.63232421875], "text": "", "type": "Picture"}, {"bbox": [673.41357421875, 218.20556640625, 777.3843994140625, 230.136474609375], "text": "CONSTITUENT CLUBS", "type": "SectionHeader"}, {"bbox": [673.41357421875, 232.119140625, 811.61572265625, 437.5641174316406], "text": "", "type": "ListGroup"}, {"bbox": [675.3544311523438, 232.119140625, 811.61572265625, 243.8790283203125], "text": "Arts and Social Sciences Club", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [675.3544311523438, 246.3720703125, 745.1984252929688, 257.7137451171875], "text": "Business Club", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [675.3544311523438, 259.9462890625, 791.87255859375, 271.54833984375], "text": "Community Service Club", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [675.3544311523438, 273.5205078125, 757.700439453125, 285.3829345703125], "text": "Computing Club", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [675.3544311523438, 288.11279296875, 765.7374877929688, 299.2176513671875], "text": "Conservatory Club", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [674.27197265625, 300.6689453125, 784.366943359375, 313.0522155761719], "text": "Cultural Activities Club", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [675.3544311523438, 315.6005859375, 737.6079711914062, 326.8869323730469], "text": "Dental Club", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [675.3544311523438, 328.49609375, 805.4009399414062, 340.7215576171875], "text": "Design &amp; Environment Club", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [675.3544311523438, 344.1064453125, 761.3994140625, 354.55621337890625], "text": "Engineering Club", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [673.41357421875, 357.6806640625, 726.4169311523438, 368.39080810546875], "text": "Law Club", "type": "ListItem"}, {"bbox": [674.27197265625, 370.576171875, 743.0134277